Local modifications to the vendored code (all documented in the header of
R/covsel-core.R): namespaced calls to Depends-only packages, base-R
de-duplication replacing a data.table idiom that errors under data.table
>= 1.18, removal of global RNG side effects, cli progress messages, per-group
`force` subsetting, name-based intercept removal, and a corrected union-rank
sequence when no covariate is selected by every algorithm.
